    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it go\"... that sounds almost peaceful, i guess. like, if the version of me that mattered is really gone, then what's even the point of this empty version hanging around? it just feels like i'm dragging around a corpse every single day. if there's nothing left to build, why bother staying in the wreckage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
